Espressif LLVM Embedded Toolchain ${LLVMEmbeddedToolchainForArm_VERSION}

Sources:
* Espressif LLVM Embedded Toolchain: https://github.com/espressif/esp-llvm-embedded-toolchain.git  (commit ${EspLLVMEmbeddedToolchain_COMMIT})
* LLVM: https://github.com/espressif/llvm-project.git (commit ${llvmproject_COMMIT})
* Picolibc: https://github.com/espressif/picolibc.git (commit ${picolibc_COMMIT})
* Newlib: https://github.com/espressif/newlib-esp32.git (commit ${newlib_COMMIT})
* Binutils: https://github.com/espressif/binutils-gdb.git (commit ${binutils_COMMIT})
* Xtensa overlays: https://github.com/espressif/xtensa-overlays (commit ${xtensa_overlays_COMMIT})
